{"title":"2026 Indonesia District MO Problems/Problem 10","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_Indonesia_District_MO_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The roots of the quadratic function <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/1/5514bbe4b865e0e3e8ea184e4f5722fd5dbf05e4.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[f(x)=x^2+px+q^2\\]\" width=\"156\" height=\"20\" />\nare integers. If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/f/36f73fc1312ee0349b3f3a0f3bd9eb5504339011.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/1/0615acc3725de21025457e7d6f7694dab8e2f758.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> are prime numbers, find the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/7/fd790111eee5c5b02558911a11d92cb15760a47e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p+2q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"51\" height=\"17\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_Indonesia_District_MO_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> be the roots. Then by <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"//artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php/Vieta%27s_formulas\">Vieta's</a>,\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/0/8201b3ddfd00d306a1c3963215012dafde01d08e.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} a+b&amp;=-p \\\\ ab&amp;=q^2 \\end{align*}\" width=\"86\" height=\"43\" />\nSince <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/f/36f73fc1312ee0349b3f3a0f3bd9eb5504339011.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/1/0615acc3725de21025457e7d6f7694dab8e2f758.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> are prime numbers and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/9/b/e9bdf3e496517e8f8742f81dd774be1f93cf6e8c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a,b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" /> are integers, then the only (unordered) pairs possible from the second equation is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/4/0/1406d4ec9ee90c50e68deb11172ef29d7f27098c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(q^2,1), (q, q), (-q^2, -1), (-q, -q)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"257\" height=\"21\" />. However, notice that when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/a/b/5abd2c942ae299fd26e18d0ca5d390a7ca4a8c34.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=b$\" width=\"42\" height=\"12\" />, it implies that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/7/df7acdd42883277b81b5d5eeb3e8d3435a8a352b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2a=-p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"68\" height=\"17\" />, contradicting the primality of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/f/36f73fc1312ee0349b3f3a0f3bd9eb5504339011.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />. If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/e/01e2758a364cebbacb30b927699a80b7156e9bd1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=q^2, b=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"101\" height=\"20\" />, it implies <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/b/5eb18848188f0947f1ec48d06789700ffb5a237d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$q^2+1=-p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"97\" height=\"20\" />, which is impossible since both <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/7/7/f779d95c15f7e41de74cb767f52fe4e7b92c745e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p,q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"28\" height=\"13\" /> are positive integers. Therefore, the only valid roots are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/0/9/009d3020fec6a5d5451462b90604f9a72a73a082.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(q^2,1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"49\" height=\"21\" />.\n</p><p>By the first equation, \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/7/0/970201cdfd39eef6f46cc68dfeb13c06be3647f1.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[-q^2-1=-p \\implies q^2+1=p\\]\" width=\"238\" height=\"19\" /> \nIf <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/1/0615acc3725de21025457e7d6f7694dab8e2f758.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> is an odd prime, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/0/4/804bdc214bb71a8607ddb48d10de8b37f14ae4a3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$q\\neq2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"44\" height=\"18\" />, then this would mean <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/7/e0774d32325127128ee74001217686f263831707.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$q^2+1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"49\" height=\"20\" /> is even, contradicting the primality of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/f/36f73fc1312ee0349b3f3a0f3bd9eb5504339011.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/f/36f73fc1312ee0349b3f3a0f3bd9eb5504339011.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> cannot be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> because that would mean <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/5/26520f2333a3d48eb4929b7517dea54293f36605.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$q=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"44\" height=\"17\" />, which isn't a prime. Therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/1/0615acc3725de21025457e7d6f7694dab8e2f758.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> must be an even prime, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/2/4/2249017892bda0490d89aa6d997b953b070b1ba1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$q=2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"41\" height=\"15\" />, and hence <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/1/7c15927aa068d9b1f1f027ac2b216fddb5cee5a0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^2+1=4+1=5=p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"181\" height=\"20\" />. \n</p><p>Now that we know that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/7/4/9744b986a275413b1d5e52af4ee4642253f606d5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p=5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"43\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/2/4/2249017892bda0490d89aa6d997b953b070b1ba1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$q=2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"41\" height=\"15\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/7/f3737fcd83794778713b99d3b6050bac9d18ef00.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p+2q=5+2\\cdot2=\\boxed{9}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"183\" height=\"25\" />\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_Indonesia_District_MO\" title=\"2026 Indonesia District MO\">2026 Indonesia District MO </a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_Indonesia_District_MO_Problems\" title=\"2026 Indonesia District MO Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_Indonesia_District_MO_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2026 Indonesia District MO Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_Indonesia_District_MO_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2026 Indonesia District MO Problems/Problem 9\">Problem 9</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_Indonesia_District_MO_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2026 Indonesia District MO Problems/Problem 11 (page does not exist)\">Problem 11</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_Indonesia_District_MO_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2026 Indonesia District MO Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_Indonesia_District_MO_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2026 Indonesia District MO Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_Indonesia_District_MO_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2026 Indonesia District MO Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_Indonesia_District_MO_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2026 Indonesia District MO Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_Indonesia_District_MO_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2026 Indonesia District MO Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_Indonesia_District_MO_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2026 Indonesia District MO Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_Indonesia_District_MO_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2026 Indonesia District MO Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_Indonesia_District_MO_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2026 Indonesia District MO Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_Indonesia_District_MO_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2026 Indonesia District MO Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_Indonesia_District_MO_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2026 Indonesia District MO Problems/Problem 11 (page does not exist)\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_Indonesia_District_MO_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2026 Indonesia District MO Problems/Problem 12 (page does not exist)\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_Indonesia_District_MO_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2026 Indonesia District MO Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_Indonesia_District_MO_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2026 Indonesia District MO Problems/Problem 14 (page does not exist)\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_Indonesia_District_MO_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2026 Indonesia District MO Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_Indonesia_District_MO_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2026 Indonesia District MO Problems/Problem 16 (page does not exist)\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_Indonesia_District_MO_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2026 Indonesia District MO Problems/Problem 17 (page does not exist)\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_Indonesia_District_MO_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"2026 Indonesia District MO Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_Indonesia_District_MO_Problems/Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2026 Indonesia District MO Problems/Problem 19 (page does not exist)\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_Indonesia_District_MO_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2026 Indonesia District MO Problems/Problem 20 (page does not exist)\">20</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Indonesia_District_MO_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"Indonesia District MO Problems and Solutions\"> All Indonesia District MO Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018034932\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.027 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.049 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 177/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2038/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 106/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 5601/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    7.537      1 Template:Indonesia_District_MO_box\n100.00%    7.537      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:37824:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018034932 and revision id 292298. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}